	(text "FLIGHT CONTROLLER (Pixhawk 6X)\n- PWM Outputs [PWM_1 to PWM_6]: 6x ESC Signal Inputs\n- Telemetry 1: 915 MHz RF Telemetry Radio (1W Output)\n- GPS / RTK: Dual Neo-3 GPS/RTK Receivers (Serial GPS1 + CAN GPS2)\n- CAN Bus: Hybrid Generator ECU Telemetry, BMS, and GPS2\n- Companion Computer : Ethernet MAVLink to Nvidia Jetson Orin Nano"
